{"id":"n93db8c1993","headline":"Sensex falls 582 pts, Nifty slips below 24,000 as oil woes, rupee weakness weigh on markets","summary":"Indian benchmark indexes fell as crude prices rose and the rupee hit a record low. The Sensex dropped 582 points and the Nifty slipped below 24,000.","why":"The Sensex and Nifty are the benchmark equity indexes of India's stock exchanges, so their moves reflect broad sentiment in Indian equities. Crude oil is a major import cost for India, so oil price rises pressure the rupee and corporate margins.","category":"markets","event_type":"macro-data","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.076,"lon":72.878,"region":"asia"},"entities":[{"name":"BSE Sensex","ticker":"^BSESN","kind":"company","sym":"SENSEX","asset":{"id":"IX:SENSEX","n":"BSE Sensex","c":"index","px":"^BSESN","la":18.93,"lo":72.83,"geo":"markets","site":"SENSEX","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}},{"name":"Nifty 50","ticker":"^NSEI","kind":"company","sym":"NIFTY","asset":{"id":"IX:NIFTY","n":"Nifty 50","c":"index","px":"^NSEI","la":19.08,"lo":72.88,"geo":"markets","site":"NIFTY","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"BusinessLine","url":"https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/sensex-nifty-slump-on-oil-woes-rupee-weakness/article70924428.ece"},"sources":[{"name":"BusinessLine","url":"https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/sensex-nifty-slump-on-oil-woes-rupee-weakness/article70924428.ece"}],"published_at":"2026-04-30T11:26:01Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"581a1f4d03c3d8df","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Crude prices rose sharply while the rupee weakened to a record low, weighing on Indian equities. Higher oil costs and a weaker currency pressure earnings expectations for oil-importing economies.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","origin